      "spam": false,
      "value": "This has been added to avatar pedastals but still needs to be added to the menu when you select a player. This is essential for legal reasons. There is plenty of art released as CC-BY Attribution that cannot be used legally unless there is a way to give credit and provide a link to the license.",
